  <!-- ===== PrivacyPolicyPage ===== -->
  <data name="Privacy_LastUpdated" xml:space="preserve"><value>Last updated: {0}</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Overview_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Overview</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Overview_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Minesweeper is a Minesweeper game that runs entirely on your device. The app requires no account and no sign-in. This document explains the small amount of data the app, along with the third-party services it uses (ads, billing), can access.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_DirectData_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Information we collect directly</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_DirectData_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>None of our servers receive your game progress or personal information. Everything — unlocked levels, star counts, best times, the game in progress, No-guess settings — is stored only locally on your device (the app's own private storage). This data is lost if you uninstall the app or clear its data in Android Settings, and we keep no copy of it.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_ThirdParty_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Information collected by third parties</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_ThirdParty_Intro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Minesweeper uses a few third-party SDKs to show ads and process Pro purchases. These services may collect data under their own policies:</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_LevelPlay_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Unity LevelPlay (ironSource) and connected ad networks</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_LevelPlay_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Shows banner/interstitial ads in the free version. May collect: Advertising ID, device/OS information, approximate location (via IP), and ad-related app usage activity.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Billing_Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Google Play Billing</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Billing_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Processes the Pro purchase (one-time, removes ads). Payment details are handled entirely by Google; we only receive confirmation that the purchase succeeded.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_ThirdParty_Outro" xml:space="preserve"><value>We don't control how these parties use data once collected. You can review their own policies:</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_UnityLink" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Unity (LevelPlay/ironSource): unity.com/legal/privacy-policy</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_GoogleLink" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Google: policies.google.com/privacy</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Permissions_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Permissions the app requests</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Permissions_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Internet &amp; network state — to load ads and process Pro purchases. Advertising ID — required from Android 13 onward for ads to work correctly, used for ad targeting/measurement. The app does NOT request camera, microphone, contacts, or precise location.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Children_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Children</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Children_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Minesweeper is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. Ads shown follow the ad content settings available on Google Play.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_DataRetention_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data storage &amp; deletion</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_DataRetention_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Since your data lives only on your device, you're always in control: uninstalling the app or clearing its data in Android Settings erases everything the app has saved. There is no account or server-side copy for us to delete on your behalf.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_PolicyChanges_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Policy changes</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_PolicyChanges_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>If this policy changes, the update will appear right on this page in the app with a new update date. Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept the new policy.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Contact_Heading" xml:space="preserve"><value>Contact</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy_Contact_Body" xml:space="preserve"><value>Questions about this policy or how Minesweeper handles data can be sent to: nguyenquynhvp.ictu@gmail.com</value></data>
